        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First impressions DRB1006BRPVC, Victorian Pocket Door Privacy Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Victorian Pocket Door Privacy Lock has a built-in edge pull so you can pull the door from its pocket. This Privacy Function Pocket Door Lock is normally used on bathroom and bedroom doors because it can offer some degree of privacy. Simply turn the lock on the interior. The Darby  Privacy Pocket Door Lock can be easily unlocked from the outside via the emergency release; as a result, it does not offer security, only privacy. The privacy set includes a strike plate for the lock arm, 2 flush pulls mounted to a lockable edge pull housing, and all the mounting hardware for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/victorian-sliding-pocket-door-passage-set-first-impressions-drb1006brpsg\"><b>Victorian Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/victorian-pocket-door-flush-pull-pair-first-impressions-drb1006138br\"><b>Victorian Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DRB1006BRPVC Victorian Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Depth: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DRB03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262215\"><b>First Impressions DRB1006BRPVC Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged as a set that includes 2 flush pulls, flip out edge pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Pocket Door Privacy Lock",
                "description": "The Victorian Pocket Door Privacy Lock has a built-in edge pull so you can pull the door from its pocket. This Privacy Function Pocket Door Lock is normally used on bathroom and bedroom doors because it can offer some degree of privacy. Simply turn the lock on the interior. The Darby  Privacy Pocket Door Lock can be easily unlocked from the outside via the emergency release; as a result, it does not offer security, only privacy. The privacy set includes a strike plate for the lock arm, 2 flush pulls mounted to a lockable edge pull housing, and all the mounting hardware for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n",
